WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.742
The explain command shows how Postgres plans to execute the statement.

00:00:04.742 --> 00:00:08.752
The purpose here is not to memorize every plan node.

00:00:08.752 --> 00:00:14.502
It is to build the habit of checking instead of guessing.

00:00:14.502 --> 00:00:21.409
On real workloads, data volume, indexes, statistics, and Postgres version all affect the plan.
